dist/
dist-ssr/
*.local

# Visual regression captures
screenshots/

# The CC0 card art IS committed (3 MB, ~53 files): the iOS build bundles it and
# CI runners cannot be relied on to re-fetch it through a proxy.
# Regenerate with `npm run fetch:cards`.

